---
import Slide from "../../components/Slide.astro"
import CodeBlock from "../../components/CodeBlock.astro"
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
import flask from "../../img/web/flask.png"
---
<Slide t1="Starting with Flask">
    <div class="flex justify-center items-center">
        <Image
            src={ flask }
            alt="Flask Logo"
            height="400"
            width="400" />
    </div>
</Slide>

<Slide t2="What is Flask?">
    <ul>
        <li class="fragment">Python server framework for building web applications</li>
        <li class="fragment">Lightweight, flexible, extensible</li>
        <li class="fragment">Not big and monolithic (like Django)</li>
        <li class="fragment">Batteries not included</li>
        <li class="fragment">Open Source</li>
    </ul>
</Slide>

<Slide t2="Setup: Visual Studio Code">
    <ul><li><code>%pip install flask</code></li></ul>

</Slide>

<Slide>
    <div class="text-sm-2">
        <CodeBlock lang="text" height="450px"> { `
