<Slide t2="Flask Test">
    <div class="text-sm-1">
        <CodeBlock lang="python" height="225px" lines="*|5">
            { `
from flask import Flask

app = Flask(__name__)
    
@app.route("/")
def hello_world():
    return "<p>Hello, World!</p>"
`.trim()
            }
        </CodeBlock>

        <CodeBlock lang="python" height="100px">
            { `app.run(port=5050)` }
        </CodeBlock>
    </div>

    <ul class="fragment text-sm-1"><li>Start the server,
        browse to <code>http://localhost:5050</code></li></ul>
</Slide>

<Slide t2="Experiment">
  <ul>
      <li class="fragment">Edit the HTML fragment: add headers, styling</li>
      <li class="fragment">(Flask templating is beyond the scope of this workshop)</li>
      <li class="fragment">Q: how many web servers are we now running?</li>
      <ul><li class="fragment">And why? &#x1F914;</li></ul>
  </ul>
</Slide>
